- **Same as last time:** the 2026-10-31 evaluation was also AVOID 3, so no new-evidence entry was needed. I only pulled that file's decision and price fields to check this. The price has risen about 8.8% since, below the 10% threshold.

**One gap:** Python also flags FCF margin as falling over 3 years. My decline explanation covers ROIC and operating margin only, and calls the decline temporary because of tariff costs and HEYDUDE.
